      "subject": "DAMIT 1021: selected shape and spin",
      "status": "included",
      "finding": "The official DAMIT metadata export was joined by model and asteroid identity and compared with the selected local recipe shape/model-1021.txt. Model 1021, version 2016-01-04, pole (54°, -10°), period 13.6638 h match the retained metadata. The archive supplies no diameter for this model; a separate scale constraint is required. This comparison checks source identity and metadata, not fresh mesh bytes, registration or the completeness of other archives.",
